's most important properties.\",\"nullable\":true,\"readOnly\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"description\":\"The type of the account identifier.\",\"enum\":[\"Unknown\",\"SCAN\",\"IBAN\",\"DD\",\"BTC\",\"BIC\"],\"readOnly\":true,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"currency\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"sourceAccountName\":{\"description\":\"The name of the account the payout is being made from.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"sourceAccountNumber\":{\"description\":\"The account number of the account the payout is being made from.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"sourceAccountSortcode\":{\"description\":\"The sort code of the account the payout is being made from.\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"status\":{\"description\":\"Gets or Sets the status of payout request\",\"enum\":[\"UNKNOWN\",\"REJECTED\",\"PENDING\",\"PROCESSED\",\"PENDING_APPROVAL\",\"QUEUED_UPSTREAM\",\"QUEUED\",\"FAILED\",\"PENDING_INPUT\",\"SCHEDULED\",\"REJECTED_APPROVAL\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"tags\":{\"description\":\"An optional list of descriptive tags attached to the payout.\",\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"colourHex\":{\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":{\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"format\":\"uuid\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"merchantID\":{\"format\":\"uuid\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"name\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"merchantID\",\"name\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"array\"},\"theirReference\":{\"description\":\"Gets or Sets destination reference ID\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"topupPayrunID\":{\"description\":\"The ID of a payrun that needs an account top up. \\r\\nPayouts can be used to top up payrun accounts.\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"transactedAmount\":{\"description\":\"The actual amount debited from the account in NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.Currency, as recorded on the settled\\r\\ntransaction. When NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxUseDestinationAmount is `false` the debit amount was fixed\\r\\nat creation, so this should closely match NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.Amount. When NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxUseDestinationAmount\\r\\nis `true` the beneficiary's received amount was fixed, so this may differ from the estimated\\r\\nNoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.Amount due to rate movement between quote and settlement.\\r\\nNull for non-FX payouts and payouts with no settled transaction.\",\"format\":\"double\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"transactedFxAmount\":{\"description\":\"The actual amount received by the beneficiary in NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxDestinationCurrency, as recorded\\r\\non the settled transaction. When NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxUseDestinationAmount is `true` the beneficiary's\\r\\nreceived amount was fixed at creation, so this should closely match NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxDestinationAmount.\\r\\nWhen NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxUseDestinationAmount is `false` the debit amount was fixed, so this may\\r\\ndiffer from the estimated NoFrixion.MoneyMoov.Models.Payout.FxDestinationAmount due to rate movement between quote and settlement.\\r\\nNull if the payout has no settled FX transaction.\",\"format\":\"double\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"transactedFxRate\":{\"description\":\"The actual FX rate applied during settlement, as recorded on the associated transaction.\\r\\nNull if the payout has no settled FX transaction.\",\"format\":\"double\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"number\"},\"type\":{\"description\":\"Gets or Sets payout type\",\"enum\":[\"Unknown\",\"SCAN\",\"IBAN\",\"DD\",\"BTC\",\"BIC\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"userID\":{\"description\":\"Gets or Sets User ID of who created the payout request\",\"format\":\"uuid\",\"nullable\":true,\"type\":\"string\"},\"yourReference\":{\"description\":\"Gets or Sets your reference ID\",\"nullable\":true,